{"ref":"character:annette","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Annette is a secret playable character introduced in the 2025 update of the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. Her starting weapon is one of ",{"i":"Sprite-Endo_Gears.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:endo-gears"}," ",{"t":"Endo Gears","r":"weapon:endo-gears"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Peri_Pendulum.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"weapon:peri-pendulum"}," ",{"t":"Peri Pendulum","r":"weapon:peri-pendulum"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Myo_Lift.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:myo-lift"}," ",{"t":"Myo Lift","r":"weapon:myo-lift"},", or ",{"i":"Sprite-Epi_Head.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:epi-head"}," ",{"t":"Epi Head","r":"weapon:epi-head"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["28 October 2025 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_ANNETTE"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_Annette_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Endo_Gears.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:endo-gears"}," ",{"t":"Endo Gears","r":"weapon:endo-gears"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Build one tower inside another"]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 5,000"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Ode_to_Castlevania-Keygen_Church.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Clockwork - Vampire Survivors\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Recovery","cells":[["1.00"]]},{"label":"Cooldown","cells":[["-10%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":21,"h":21,"a":"A sprite icon representing Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane linking to Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," \"Build one tower inside another\"\nFull unlock method hidden. Click \"Show Details\" to unhide."]},{"k":"p","c":["After obtaining the ",{"i":"Sprite-Pile_of_Secrets.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"relic:pile-of-secrets"}," ",{"t":"Pile of Secrets","r":"relic:pile-of-secrets"},", Annette can be unlocked by creating the ",{"i":"Sprite-Clock_Tower.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:clock-tower"}," ",{"t":"Clock Tower","r":"weapon:clock-tower"}," while playing on ",{"t":"Gallo Tower","r":"stage:gallo-tower"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once unlocked, Annette can be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 5,000, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Annette can be unlocked in the ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"aljibarian\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Annette starts with +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"}," and -10% ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},". When entering a stage as Annette, all four clockwork weapons are spawned nearby as ",{"t":"Stage Items","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Stage_item"},". ",{"i":"Sprite-Endo_Gears.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:endo-gears"}," ",{"t":"Endo Gears","r":"weapon:endo-gears"}," spawns to the north, ",{"i":"Sprite-Myo_Lift.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:myo-lift"}," ",{"t":"Myo Lift","r":"weapon:myo-lift"}," to the west, ",{"i":"Sprite-Peri_Pendulum.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"weapon:peri-pendulum"}," ",{"t":"Peri Pendulum","r":"weapon:peri-pendulum"}," to the east, and ",{"i":"Sprite-Epi_Head.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:epi-head"}," ",{"t":"Epi Head","r":"weapon:epi-head"}," to the south."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["The choice of starting weapon does not affect which weapons spawn, so the player is effectively given a free level up for their choice of starting weapon."]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Picking up ",{"i":"Sprite-Dominus_Hatred.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:dominus-hatred"}," ",{"t":"Dominus Hatred","r":"weapon:dominus-hatred"}," and upgrading it to level 6 will transform Annette into ",{"i":"Sprite-Carmilla.png","w":16,"h":24,"r":"character:carmilla"}," ",{"t":"Carmilla","r":"character:carmilla"}," along with recieving her stats and passive bonuses."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Annette.png","w":90,"h":120,"c":["Annette's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Annette.gif","w":90,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]},{"i":"Sprite-Annette_(old).png","w":85,"h":120,"c":["Old sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Annette_(old).gif","w":88,"h":120,"c":["Old movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["beta ",{"i":"Steam_logo.svg","w":16,"h":16,"a":"Steam"}," 4 December 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed choosing annette as an AI party member causing the game to soft lock in party mode"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["hotfix 31 October 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Updating OtC Annette, correct sprite and portrait"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 28 October 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Annette's unlock condition, theme music, and starting weapons are all a reference to her being imprisoned in the ",{"t":"Clock Tower","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Rondo_of_Blood_Stage_7"}," in ",{"t":"Castlevania: Rondo of Blood","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Castlevania:_Rondo_of_Blood"},"."]},{"c":["Annette's sprites were initially designed after her appearance in ",{"t":"Castlevania: The Dracula X Chronicles","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Castlevania:_The_Dracula_X_Chronicles"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Annette","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Annette"}," on the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"PowerUp-Growth.png","w":40,"h":40}]},{"k":"p","c":["Stub"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article is a stub. You can help Vampire Survivors Wiki by ",{"t":"expanding it","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Annette?action=edit"},"."]}],"subs":[]}]}